All 121 tests pass, lint is clean, build succeeds. Here is a summary of every change made:

**`src/styles/directory.css`**
- Added `margin-bottom: var(--space-5)` on `#contacts-add-area` so the "+ Add Contact" button has a comfortable gap above the A-Z tabs.
- Gave `.import-label` explicit `min-height: 36px` and matching padding so it aligns vertically with the Export button (both use `.btn-sm` geometry).
- Added `white-space: nowrap` to `.emergency-name` and `.emergency-phone` to prevent mid-word wraps. Added a `@media (max-width: 360px)` rule that collapses `.emergency-row` to a single column, so at 320 px the number drops under the name rather than wrapping beside it.

**`src/styles/layout.css`**
- Changed `#theme-toggle` from `font-size: var(--text-lg)` (inheriting the browser's default sans) to `font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600`, matching the `.btn-sm` secondary buttons.

**`src/styles/print.css`**
- Replaced the broken `--space-md/--space-sm/--space-lg/--font-size-*` undefined variables with the correct `--space-*` and `--text-*` tokens throughout the screen-side rules.
- Changed `.print-btn-group` gap to `var(--space-3)` so stacked buttons have a visible gap.
- Added `.print-scale-hint` paragraph style and suppressed it inside `@media print`.
- Rewrote `.wallet-face-preview` with `aspect-ratio: 3.375 / 2.125`, `border-radius`, and `box-shadow` for a card appearance; added `flex: 1 1 160px` for side-by-side when wide, stacked when narrow.
- Replaced single-span `.wallet-row-preview` with a flex row containing `.wallet-row-name` (truncates) and `.wallet-row-phone` (`white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0`) so phone numbers are never clipped.
- All `@media print` rules are unchanged.

**`src/ui/print.ts`**
- Updated `renderPreviewScreenOnly` to build wallet rows using the new two-span structure (`.wallet-row-name` + `.wallet-row-phone`).
- Added the scale hint `<p class="print-scale-hint">` after the button group in `initPrint`.

**`.kiro/specs/dead-phone-directory/tasks.md`**
- Ticked T13's "Verify zero network requests at runtime" item and appended "(verified in browser QA, 2026-11-18)".
